    "turn_text": "Welcome back, friends. Again, DestinyUSA has hired lobbyists to speak to the Trump administration, hoping to get things squared away with the I-81 rebuilding of fashion that doesn't destroy DestinyUSA. The paper, of course, vilifies DestinyUSA and its parent company, Pyramid. The paper is wrong. The mall is right. the impact of the community grid will, I think, probably kill Destiny USA, the largest collector of sales tax in Anandaga",
